{"id":"8456ef2f95a0bbcd","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Orthogonal Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Orthogonal Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Orthogonal Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Orthogonal Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, ideal, and orthogonal ideal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathcal J=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal P(X))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathcal J=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal P(X))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC ideal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6OrthogonalIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathcal J=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal P(X))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1101,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal6-orthogonal-ideal]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}